#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1151 expect=skipped domain=TI
#note "Requirements.Variables.All: [IETESTCD] skips and names it. Note the asymmetry with SD1150, which is deliberate: each rule gates on its own TARGET through Requirements.Variables and tests the OTHER variable's presence with var_exists inside the Check."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TI
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col IETEST  type=Char
col TIVERS  type=Char
---
S1 | TI | Age 18 years or older | 1
